ces><source category="A" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-7169825-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>7169825</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1115146A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>AMANO HIDEAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TOKYO ELECTRON LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>AMANO, HIDEAKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOKYO ELECTRON LIMITED</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>AMANO HIDEAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>AMANO, HIDEAKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A semiconductor wafer (W) is placed on a stage (3) in a vacuum container of a vacuum processing apparatus such as an apparatus for film forming and etching, and the wafer is processed while gaseous heat medium, such as helium, is supplied between the wafer and the stage to maintain the wafer at predetermined temperature. To detect an abnormal leakage of the helium gas between the wafer and the stage easily, the wafer is held by an electrostatic chuck on the stage of dielectric substance with a mirror finish, so that the helium gas from a gas channel (5) is confined under the wafer. A flow meter is provided in the gas channel. If a threshold corresponding to a given leakage is exceeded, a warning signal is issued.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>On place une tranche (W) de semi-conducteur sur un étage (3) d'un conteneur sous vide d'un appareil de traitement sous vide, tel qu'un appareil de formation et de gravure de film. Pour le traitement de ladite tranche, on envoie un gaz caloporteur, tel que de l'hélium, entre la galette et le plateau, de façon à maintenir la galette à une température prédéterminée. Pour détecter facilement une fuite anormale d'hélium entre la galette et le plateau, on maintient la galette au moyen d'un mandrin électrostatique sur le plateau constitué d'une substance diélectrique traitée par polissage de qualité optique, de façon que l'hélium provenant d'une conduite à gaz (5) soit confiné sous la galette. Un débitmètre est disposé dans ladite conduite à gaz. Si un seuil correspondant à une fuite donnée est dépassé, un signal d'avertissement est émis.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>